title mmWave Radar: larger screens scale (800x480, 480x800, 1280x800, 720x720): radar and table
sizes 800x480 480x800 1280x800 720x720 480x640
env MMWAVE_DEMO three
env MMWAVE_TEST_CONFIG 1

wait 3000
shot radar
check radar
key 2
wait 500
shot table
check table
key 4
wait 500
shot sensor
check sensor
expect noquit
